# ====================================================================
# CAD Auto CloudNote - 100% 极纯源码与文档过滤配置 (.gitignore)
# 策略：严格禁止任何可执行程序(exe)、动态库(dll)、构建物(build/)入库
#      仅允许纯源代码、项目配置文件、说明文档与核心矢量图标资源
# ====================================================================

# 1. 全局二进制可执行程序与系统动态库 (Binaries & Executables)
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.msi
*.com
*.bin
*.pdb
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json

# 2. 构建产物与发布交付目录 (Build Outputs & Packages)
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
packages/
*.nupkg
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# 3. 本地第三方 SDK 二进制依赖 (External SDK DLLs)
# 本项目依赖的 AutoCAD SDK 属于 Autodesk® 专有商业库，遵循开源纯净性原则不随源码入库
Libs/**/*.dll

# 4. AutoCAD 插件部署包中的编译物 (Bundle Binary Outputs)
CADAutoCloudNote.bundle/Contents/**/*.dll
CADAutoCloudNote.bundle/Contents/**/*.deps.json

# 5. Visual Studio / VS Code 缓存与用户个人配置
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosv
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user
*.suo.template
*.ide/
*.ncb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile

# 6. AutoCAD / 浩辰 / 中望 绘图运行时临时与锁定文件
*.dwl
*.dwl2
*.ac$
*.sv$
*.dcl
*.bak
*.bk[0-9]
*.err
plot.log
acad.err
acad.log

# 7. 运行时日志、内存转储与临时文件夹
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.dmp
*.crash
scratch/
.system_generated/
*.swp
*~

# 8. 测试覆盖率输出 (Coverage)
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.trx

# 9. 压缩包与临时打包文件
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar*

# 10. 操作系统杂项文件 (OS Files)
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
